# P102 on WSL GtkBackend: ported 2026-10-20 from actions/win/P102-long-press-drag.actions; the steps and pass condition are the Windows file's, quoted below. Positions from the AT-SPI dump under WSLg (x11), client coordinates, origin empty; a control named in a row's note was looked up by that name.
# P102(WSL):由 actions/win/P102-long-press-drag.actions 移植(2026-10-20),步驟與通過條件同下方 Windows 原文；座標取自 WSLg 下的 AT-SPI,為 client 座標。
# P102 on Windows, WinUIBackend: longPressTextSelection() in a TextField and a TextEditor, and not in a
# plain TextField -- the same steps as actions/mac/P102-long-press-drag.actions, re-measured for WinUI.
# Positions from measure_win.zsh and the capture on 2026-10-19, in DIPs (display at 125%; origin=frame).
# Window 454x558. FIELD text at y 189 ('quick' at x 76), EDITOR lines at y 253/270/288, CONTROL at y 406.
# Pass (p102-select.log): FIELD began with an empty range then ended forward and non-empty; EDITOR ended
# backward; no line at all for the CONTROL press or for the quick FIELD drag at the end (held 0.1 s).
# P102(Windows,WinUIBackend):長按後拖曳，步驟同 actions/mac/P102-long-press-drag.actions,座標為 WinUI 重新量測
# (2026-10-19,DIP)。通過條件:FIELD 先以空範圍 began、再以非空的正向範圍 ended;EDITOR ended 為 backward;
# CONTROL 的長按與最後那次快速拖曳都不能有任何一行。
sleep,,,,,,1500000,let P102 lay out,gtk
